  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID/Rwanda Feed-the-Future Rwanda Trade Facilitation Activity (RTFA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity will provide technical assistance for the following specific objectives in Rwanda: 1. Facilitate inclusive and resilience-focused policy reforms using evidence-based analysis and strengthened advocacy capacity of the private sector organizations,2. Support local actors to attract, mobilize, and direct public and private financing resources towards productive priority agriculture and food export projects supporting increased agriculture and food exports</narrative>
  </description>
